          {
            "id": "p8",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "- À basse température (50-80 °C), le nickel impur réagit avec le monoxyde de carbone :",
            "start": 841,
            "end": 927
          },
          {
            "id": "p9",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation",
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "  Ni (impur) + 4 CO → Ni(CO)₄ (gaz)",
            "start": 928,
            "end": 963
          },
          {
            "id": "p10",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "- Le Ni(CO)₄, très volatil, est distillé et transporté.",
            "start": 964,
            "end": 1019
          },
          {
            "id": "p11",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "- À environ 180-200 °C, il se décompose :",
            "start": 1020,
            "end": 1061
          },
          {
            "id": "p12",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation",
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "  Ni(CO)₄ → Ni (pur) + 4 CO",
            "start": 1062,
            "end": 1089
          },
          {
            "id": "p13",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "Le nickel pur se dépose sous forme solide et le CO est recyclé.",
            "start": 1090,
            "end": 1153
          },
          {
            "id": "p14",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "Les impuretés (cuivre, fer…) ne forment pas de composés volatils et restent dans le résidu. Cette méthode donne un nickel de très haute pureté.",
